		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  cet horrible $$ dans le create function]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=24839#p24839"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>Vous pouvez aussi initialiser le search_path directement à la connexion. Eg.:</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>$ psql &lt;&lt;&#039;EOQ&#039;                                     
SELECT current_setting($$search_path$$);
EOQ

 current_setting 
-----------------
 &quot;$user&quot;,public
(1 row)

$ PGOPTIONS=&quot;--search_path=pg_catalog&quot; psql &lt;&lt;&#039;EOQ&#039;
SELECT current_setting($$search_path$$);
EOQ

 current_setting 
-----------------
 pg_catalog
(1 row)</code></pre></div>]]></content>
